1 HELP
 HELP is how you read this library. The text of a library's HELP topic
 is what HELP shows when it is given no topic.
2 Sub
 A subtopic of HELP.
1 ALPHA
 The ALPHA topic, written for vmsport to record how HELP lays out
 text, subtopics and prompts. It has subtopics.

 Format

   ALPHA [file-spec]
2 Parameters
 file-spec

 The file ALPHA works on.
2 Qualifiers
 Text of the Qualifiers subtopic itself.
/LOG

    /LOG
    /NOLOG (default)

 Shows each file as ALPHA works on it.
/COUNT

    /COUNT=n

 How many times.
/CONFIRM
 Asks first.
2 Examples
 1.$ ALPHA X.TXT

   Works on X.TXT.
2 SUBTOPIC_ONE
 Text of the first subtopic.
3 DEEPER
 Text at level three.
3 DEEPEST_NAME_THAT_IS_RATHER_LONG
 A long subtopic name.
2 SUBTOPIC_TWO
 Text of the second subtopic.
1 BETA
 The BETA topic has no subtopics.
1 BETTER
 BETTER starts like BETA.
1 GAMMA_LONGNAME
 A topic with a long name, to see the columns.
1 DELTA
 Delta text.
